        "title": "A sample patient-information landing page",
        "subtitle": "Fixture content for offline builds",
        "description": "<p>This page is built from local fixture files instead of the Kontent Delivery API. It exercises the intro, info block, card, call-to-action and reference components with neutral demo copy.</p>",
